BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ec3912ad-d37f-3bb2-9f47-f1aff5b50f95.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
